vnsnowkey (1.0.6) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix browser URL and search bar inline autocomplete: replace selected suggestions with atomic KEY_DELETE before diff backspacing, eliminating 'd' -> 'dđ' and diacritic corruption.
  * Eliminate fast-typing Vietnamese lockout: auto-unlock word buffer when evolving into valid syllables (e.g. "truyền") without requiring space or full-word deletion.
  * Prevent premature English locking when auto_restore_english=false and improve mid-typing composition resilience across Wayland and X11.

 -- VNSnowKey Contributors <vnsnowkey@localhost>  Sat, 21 Nov 2026 18:00:00 +0700

vnsnowkey (1.0.5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Unify Wayland and X11 output pacing (default_delay_us = 1200) to prevent dropped accents/characters during fast typing on X11, XWayland, and Wayland browsers.
  * Disable intrusive Space+Backspace browser autocomplete_fix by default (and migrate v2 -> v3 configs), restoring clean Vietnamese input in Firefox, Brave, Chrome, and Edge.
  * Harden X11 xkbcomp fallback and ensure XWayland displays receive the 8-level overlay when started lazily.

 -- VNSnowKey Contributors <vnsnowkey@localhost>  Fri, 20 Nov 2026 22:25:00 +0700

vnsnowkey (1.0.4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Always reset typing buffer on Enter/Tab/Esc/Insert and browser autocomplete navigation even when reset_on_navigation_keys=false.
  * Prevent per-app hotkey/tray toggles from leaking EN to config.toml or unseen apps, sync langToggleEpoch against focus races, and preserve live language across IM/charset switches.
  * Cancel pending mod-only hotkeys (Ctrl+Alt) on mouse wheel scroll or extra mouse buttons, resync held modifiers on SYN_DROPPED, and restrict caption password detection to system/unclassed dialogs.

 -- VNSnowKey Contributors <vnsnowkey@localhost>  Fri, 20 Nov 2026 20:10:00 +0700

vnsnowkey (1.0.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix CapsLock case synchronization across ASCII pass-through and Vietnamese diffs (preventing CHÀo / chÀO).
  * Fix mid-typing Vietnamese loss from browser tab caption false-positives, per-app state leaks, X11 MappingNotify XKB resets, and multi-keyboard modifier disconnects.

